msgid "BLHeli32,AM32, and BLHeli_S ESCs"
msgstr "BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:7
#: 0a5b4885cb074479800cfdd85653a83e 1c5da1929c1b4bd2995fbd340103a784
#: 672bd5a10f1b4f1aa1452b2d8b13c1c8 6b1c227351a1441fa711a82978d60299
#: b47d6bce1769421caf5cadd439d578d5
msgid ""
"if you are using BLHeli32 ESCs, be sure to update to the latest "
"BLHeliSuite32 Rev32.10.0.0 firmware, to avoid surprise uncontrollable motor "
"starts due to a BLHel32 firmware bug!"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 BLHeli32 ESC，请务必更新到最新的 BLHeliSuite32 Rev32.10.0.0 固件，以避免因 BLHel32 固件 "
"bug 导致意外的不可控电机启动！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:9
#: 065da5a3c47e4bf2a7ba12f4cdec098c 4ecdb87b9b7a4d9e8f29441e903182d4
#: 704f243af410486ba6312c7b78568def 74ef27e9ec1742e1a2367446a10e2e6b
#: adea4a48e4b347c19d82afe6f3e319d3
msgid ""
"The BLHeli firmware and configuration applications were developed to allow "
"the configuration of ESCs and provide additional features. ESCs with this "
"firmware allow configuring timing, motor direction, LEDs, motor drive "
"frequency, etc.  Before attempting to use BLHeli please follow the "
":ref:`DShot setup instructions <common-dshot-escs>`."
msgstr ""
"BLHeli 固件和配置应用程序的开发旨在允许配置 ESC 并提供附加功能。搭载此固件的 ESC 允许配置时序、电机方向、LED、电机驱动频率等。使用 "
"BLHeli 之前，请先按照 :ref:`DShot 设置说明 <common-dshot-escs>` 进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:11
#: 02a03f7d36a745418cf9f9741dc5c7fb 23c70246976c4fd1abfbbd1d1ecabc0d
#: 3fc64e1fe9894394925457f9b35d5bb1 473a078fd25d4f0e98423f48e25ddcda
#: e97f6d93695846ed8528ba3e93071cc4
msgid ""
"Depending on the ESC, BLHeli/BLHeli_S/BLHeli32/AM32 provides the following "
"features:"
msgstr "根据 ESC 的不同，BLHeli/BLHeli_S/BLHeli32/AM32 提供以下功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:13
#: 297a383e7a2a4647a0edf6e4207cad8e 56d8a330b3c9425a9f2c33b9c671787f
#: 70caa9248bca4799b98e7d149dbbf281 a147285b346b4e139c26629ef97397f9
#: cd486c8d0cc7414cb4babd9d05192d41
msgid ""
"Pass-Through support in ArduPilot allows the BLHeliSuite, AM32 and other ESC"
" configurators to be used to configure the ESCs while remaining connected to"
" the autopilot via USB cable."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的直通支持允许在 ESC 仍通过 USB 线缆连接到飞控的情况下，使用 BLHeliSuite、AM32 及其他 ESC "
"配置工具对 ESC 进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:14
#: 1625bb9495b9456ca3e8463b12b3557d 458b696e70df443e96b2a45c6d7a0e81
#: 4f966a81ceac4dc5ba70ed19d1d347fc 7c80571183804faeaaf955d70e18d2fb
#: c1c377a9258446ea98fd5426341a8518
msgid ""
":ref:`Reversible DShot <blheli32-reversible-dshot>` (aka 3D mode) allows the"
" motor to be spun in either direction"
msgstr ":ref:`可逆 DShot <blheli32-reversible-dshot>` （又称 3D 模式）允许电机在两个方向上旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:15
#: 1fde70d56f3c44ca9230e9b6ae7aea89 74d2b897e6d04da2b2990af977c8bf05
#: 7729c58e42e740fe99eedacbb344a6c3 84f5c814f0f2445db8d0b60d96ed57f3
#: 9832f76af0cf4bfea777427cf71f6f52
msgid ""
":ref:`Bi-directional DShot <bidir-dshot>` allows the ESCs to send RPM back "
"to the autopilot without the need for an additional telemetry connection"
msgstr ":ref:`双向 DShot <bidir-dshot>` 允许 ESC 将转速回传给飞控，无需额外的数传连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:16
#: 0b1c42afc17d49e297983fbc5d098a9e 458bc679be4943348c592fd7cf928c87
#: 5fae213b28c44dbfbf4baca2ad22d55c 6fdc67a35d394327848e433294ff58fb
#: d27059b1cde84c4e9926c794d8ec8f9a
msgid ""
":ref:`ESC Telemetry <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` allows the ESCs to send RPM, "
"voltage and current information back to the autopilot so that it can be "
"logged, viewed in real-time or even allow the removal of a :ref:`battery "
"monitor <esc-telemetry-based-battery-monitor>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ESC 数传 <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 允许 ESC "
"将转速、电压和电流信息回传给飞控，以便记录、实时查看，甚至可以取代 :ref:`电池监测器 <esc-telemetry-based-battery-"
"monitor>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:18
#: 079f4e0f5ed7485481f5677fcf32ab17 2c27236d638c4c1e8ba4195619372dc1
#: 30b5427ef951420495f58f30578b18d4 77377060d4154c97b51f32358795288e
#: 795cdf64c79643108a09dfa3ce3f823e
msgid ""
"\"BLHeli\" (and now AM32) covers multiple (sometimes competing) projects "
"providing ESCs firmware and accompanying configuration software"
msgstr "「BLHeli」（现在还有 AM32）涵盖多个（有时相互竞争的）提供 ESC 固件及配套配置软件的项目"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:20
#: 5861d49e5aba477e87c65328e21be979 a73b9df8311f4759aeacbd4c3200ce77
#: cf85e1f9b6504a99ae36df83e217e20b d0d8885cdc7b441e9fc2b86b266ce9db
#: de5ebc09d5ed4f39a724a0839ee9c9a5
msgid ""
"BLHeli was the original open source software that is no longer maintained "
"and is not available on modern ESCs"
msgstr "BLHeli 是最初的开源软件，已不再维护，现代 ESC 上不再可用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:21
#: 1fcb6c88178b44da8cf1235563d403b3 4f14e9d0cb434e80aee7643caedbe33d
#: 7ceb551a48644cab8646a9ccd8d074b4 bc5f3f3c3a954b50b8179ab52a6682f8
#: d2268f90e6c14ff194f907aaf10287ad
msgid ""
"BLHeli32is closed source and based on 32bit ARM MCUs and development and "
"licensing was terminated in 2024.  All modern BLHeli ESCs use BLHeli32 but "
"will be replaced with AM32 in the future."
msgstr ""
"BLHeli32 是基于 32 位 ARM MCU 的闭源软件，开发和授权已于 2024 年终止。所有现代 BLHeli ESC 均使用 "
"BLHeli32，但未来将被 AM32 取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:22
#: 1393fce157bb470ca068f72d3acb3ec3 18b03f81562a46ba8b41d453e201850e
#: 4fdb5991db94484684bea00aee53b281 a58574c70c6648b1b106c3186d5590cd
#: e8bf8034f92a42c18219cec631dbb2a4
msgid ""
"`AM32 <https://am32.ca>`__ is open source with the same features as BLHeli32"
" before it became unavailable for new designs but continues to evolve."
msgstr "`AM32 <https://am32.ca>`__ 是开源软件，具有 BLHeli32 停止供应新设计前的相同功能，并持续发展。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:23
