msgstr "`BLHeli_S JESC <https://jflight.net>`__ 是付费闭源软件，16 位，可在低端硬件上运行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:25
#: 928bb2cfea8342b08174b08254a8a4c9 9e8a987ccc57471e8472b919e20550d6
#: ba32fa3192144f109a4370764263d9f6 bd20356a75dd4cd4b326f32127620e62
#: efba0fabef444e078d33a79ed33fd347
