"`BLHeli_S BlueJay <https://github.com/mathiasvr/bluejay>`__ 是免费开源软件，16 位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:26
#: 45d55d36cb334e348496d146755cd1ba 57f61c8bd2ba4a8a8309b6b49f26fe2f
#: aee547c5c89f4a3a84da34996cdca53b d7935955d6334f43959dcce5d33831d4
