#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:31
#: 0884341d51e441c58e65abef825fb1a9 46451468cc274c42abc1e5f5031936e9
#: 900b336b60ca464eb2ea847fd49dac87 cf743dacb6c940ceb9a6729dc0de50be
#: f90848523f3c44278ce93e250a3983fd
msgid "Pass-Through Support"
msgstr "直通支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:34
#: 1fd4d5438f144dfabf35a487eb9363b6 641251f87ec141b5b3450c7a276ee3b9
#: 6c10c701e6984b9caa488ff3ce960967 73b9bda1283e48d0b117de57ad3b4fc4
#: f213f22208c0407e97cebf10ed4ebc3f
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on NON IOMCU outputs. Autopilots which have "
"an IOMCU co-processsor (usually marked as having \"MAIN\" outputs from the "
"IOMCU and \"AUX\" outputs from the main cpu) will not pass-through on those "
"outputs. Use this feature on \"AUX\" or \"FMU\" outputs with DShot "
"capability. For Plane, Rover and Sub, be mindful that using AUX outputs for "
"vehicle-critical controls removes the benefits of an IOMCU. For Copter, "
"IOMCU redundancy is not effective since it has no \"MANUAL\" control mode. "
"For maximum robustness (on Plane which has a manual mode which can be used "
"if the FMU fails), switch your motors to \"AUX\" or \"FMU\" only when "
"configuring with passthrough, and move them back to \"MAIN\" once "
"configuration is complete."
msgstr ""
"此功能仅在非 IOMCU 输出上可用。具有 IOMCU 协处理器的飞控（通常标记为 IOMCU 提供「MAIN」输出，主 CPU "
"提供「AUX」输出）不支持在这些输出上直通。请在具有 DShot 功能的「AUX」或「FMU」输出上使用此功能。对于 Plane、Rover 和 "
"Sub，请注意将 AUX 输出用于飞行关键控制会失去 IOMCU 的冗余优势。对于 Copter，IOMCU "
"冗余无效，因为没有「手动」控制模式。为了最大健壮性（对于有手动模式的 Plane，在 FMU "
"故障时可使用手动模式），仅在使用直通配置时将电机切换到「AUX」或「FMU」，配置完成后再切换回「MAIN」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:38
#: 0b4d487b159c407c8ca0dc8fb1cb30fe 7198f8ac1c55426d9574098885d054e9
#: 7586808d6e8447eda8e1e67477d1b0e2 96ad6fe456e741f49d222e75352ca48c
#: cffe7d43db6f4294b59865958255314c
msgid ""
"The Pass-Through feature allows BLHeli32, AM32, and BLHeli_S ESCs to be "
"upgraded and configured using the corresponding BLHeliSuite32, AM32 "
"Configurator, or BLHeliSuite application (running on the user's PC) while "
"the ESCs remain connected to the autopilot.  To use this feature please "
"follow these steps"
msgstr ""
"直通功能允许在 ESC 仍连接到飞控的情况下，使用相应的 BLHeliSuite32、AM32 配置器或 BLHeliSuite 应用程序（在用户 PC"
" 上运行）对 BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S ESC 进行升级和配置。请按以下步骤使用此功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:40
#: 55638d7fcef14f55b3ce362ccc97b7a0 a09781b2f9194ae6a61eac9d3b93f034
#: ded1a63e2f54472ebe82518be3297c56 e7469338b1fa4fd1931f3d79fc738b1b
#: fa377805b45041d4b6577e2e28a0cb2b
msgid ""
"Download and install `Linux or Windows AM32 configurator "
"<https://am32.ca/downloads>`__ (for use with AM32 ESCs), `BLHeliSuite32 "
"<https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli/releases>`__ (for use with BLHeli32/AM32 "
"ESCs), `BLHeliSuite <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__ (for BLHeli_S "
"ESC) or `JESC configurator <https://github.com/jflight-public/jesc-"
"configurator/releases>`__ (for use with BLHeli_S JESC) on your PC."
msgstr ""
"在 PC 上下载并安装 `Linux 或 Windows AM32 配置器 <https://am32.ca/downloads>`__ （用于 "
"AM32 ESC）、`BLHeliSuite32 <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli/releases>`__ （用于"
" BLHeli32/AM32 ESC）、`BLHeliSuite <https://github.com/bitdump/BLHeli>`__ （用于 "
"BLHeli_S ESC）或 `JESC 配置器 <https://github.com/jflight-public/jesc-"
"configurator/releases>`__ （用于 BLHeli_S JESC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:41
#: 12aabb73b16f494f84af5cf625584749 399167adcbbe4a148d3fb9ce2f5fb320
#: 50e0484d0b32488594aef232f2bbc8e7 5d356ed73e074008aa020b2309a07db1
#: a199735013a340a2b363bc11d41d879f
msgid ""
"Connect your PC to the autopilot using a USB cable and then connect with a "
"ground station (e.g. Mission Planner, QGC)."
msgstr "用 USB 线缆将 PC 连接到飞控，然后连接地面站（如 Mission Planner、QGC）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:42
#: 4dd9db1727f74670ab728507de3382c8 5db607e13786470789eedc575ad57347
#: 7b563994def74300b11ec28f3a98d735 863fd0fdb0654a89b9e23916fe690965
#: 8d3c163e843441488740e4eb18eafbe2
msgid "Disconnect your propellers"
msgstr "拆下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:43
#: 0936ac7241694064b0986015d8db8f76 338baaac6f204130ad1a25972175d7ac
#: 33f9b3e54db247a38f823b4f33833f00 63baf0199521494fac02fb99ab4c0591
#: c85fab1af6074793a2ab640ba57b46f0
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO <SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` to 1 to automatically enable "
"pass-through on all outputs configured as motors (e.g. :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION"
" <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = \"Motor1\", \"Motor2\", etc) for multicopters and "
"quadplanes or throttle (e.g. those with :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` set to 70 (\"throttle\"), 73 (\"throttle left\") or 74 "
"(\"throttle right\")) on rovers.  For most multicopters, quadplanes and "
"rovers this will do the right thing but for planes, set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK"
" <SERVO_BLH_MASK>` to enable pass-through on the appropriate servo outputs."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO <SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` 设为 1，以自动在所有配置为电机的输出（如 "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` = "
"「Motor1」、「Motor2」等）上为多旋翼和四旋翼固定翼启用直通，或在油门输出（如 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设为 70（「油门」）、73（「左油门」）或 74（「右油门」））上为 Rover "
"启用直通。对于大多数多旋翼、四旋翼固定翼和 Rover，这会自动正确处理；对于 Plane，请设置 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK "
"<SERVO_BLH_MASK>` 以在适当的舵机输出上启用直通。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:44
#: 1664a7f137e44bf29458ec710777a0b7 69b2d043df994515bbb8788d1fee1bf4
#: bc8a1132ed2645d2b2882796f97f15a5 bd97e37dd26844958cce6f3ad23be4ec
#: eb10732826fd490bb9ffb5184af974ec
msgid ""
"If your PC is connected to the autopilot using a telemetry radio (instead of"
" using USB cable as recommended above) set :ref:`SERVO_BLH_PORT "
"<SERVO_BLH_PORT>` to the autopilot port connected to the telemetry radio.  "
"Beware that this is does NOT specify the port used for :ref:`ESC telemetry "
"<blheli32-esc-telemetry>` feedback to your autopilot!"
msgstr ""
"如果 PC 通过数传电台（而非建议的 USB 线缆）连接到飞控，请将 :ref:`SERVO_BLH_PORT <SERVO_BLH_PORT>` "
"设置为连接数传电台的飞控端口。注意，这并非指定用于 :ref:`ESC 数传 <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 回传给飞控的端口！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blheli32-passthru.rst:45
